1
00:00:00,845 --> 00:00:02,825
(Bernadette:)FYI, she's getting you
a watch for your birthday

2
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:04,250
(Bernadette:)with money she took
out of your wallet.

3
00:00:10,588 --> 00:00:13,538
(Sheldon:)I don't mean to be rude
or discourteous,

4
00:00:13,691 --> 00:00:15,901
(Sheldon:)but before we begin,
l'd just like to say

5
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:18,670
(Sheldon:)there is absolutely
no scientific evidence

6
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:20,780
(Sheldon:)to support clairvoyance of any kind.

7
00:00:20,932 --> 00:00:25,212
(Sheldon:)Which means,
and again, no insult intended,

8
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:26,870
but you're a fraud...

9
00:00:28,106 --> 00:00:29,946
(Sheldon:)...your profession is a swindle,

10
00:00:30,108 --> 00:00:34,288
and your livelihood is dependent
on the gullibility of stupid people.

11
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:38,090
Again, no offense.

12
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:40,620
(Penny:)All right, Sheldon,
just ask your question.

13
00:00:43,921 --> 00:00:46,301
(Sheldon:)Okay, I just did.
What was it?

14
00:00:47,425 --> 00:00:49,765
(Penny:)Oh, for God's sake. Look, he's a
physicist who's trying to figure out

15
00:00:49,927 --> 00:00:51,237
what his next Held
of study should be.

16
00:00:51,395 --> 00:00:55,365
(Sheldon:)For your information, I was asking her
about the next Star Trek movie.

17
00:00:55,533 --> 00:00:59,143
(Penny:)I'll be bored.

